        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12532333/comment/13155547",
          "id": "13155547",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mduerig",
            "name": "mduerig",
            "key": "mduerig",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=mduerig&avatarId=13834",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=mduerig&avatarId=13834",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=mduerig&avatarId=13834",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=mduerig&avatarId=13834"
            },
            "displayName": "Michael D\u00fcrig",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Bucharest"
          },
          "body": "I tested both my suggestions from above. Both works so far. With the WeakReference based approach one has to take care to use a super class which overrides equals and hashCode delegating to the referent. Also this approach seems heavier on GC: I see more GC cycles than with the hash code based approach. ",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mduerig",
            "name": "mduerig",
            "key": "mduerig",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=mduerig&avatarId=13834",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=mduerig&avatarId=13834",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=mduerig&avatarId=13834",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=mduerig&avatarId=13834"
            },
            "displayName": "Michael D\u00fcrig",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Bucharest"
          },
          "created": "2011-11-22T23:02:56.874+0000",
          "updated": "2011-11-22T23:02:56.874+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12532333/comment/13155797",
          "id": "13155797",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mreutegg",
            "name": "mreutegg",
            "key": "mreutegg",
            "avatarUrls": {
