              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=mreutegg&avatarId=18658"
            },
            "displayName": "Marcel Reutegger",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Zurich"
          },
          "body": "Hmm, I can't remember why the comparator source is part of the Key. I agree with both of you that it isn't necessary because it has no influence on the ValueIndex that is created.\n\n+1 for the patch.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mreutegg",
